春秋 战国 秦（卷一）","excerpts":[{"context_after":"。孝公作为咸阳，徙都之[今西安府咸阳县东三十里咸阳故城也...","context_before":"...德公初居雍城大郑宫。《括地志》：雍县南七里故雍城是也]，","source_end_index":331,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"8af1a4eb-f6b5-56b2-9166-5ff1503f97c4","source_start_index":308,"source_text":"献公徙栎阳[即今西安府临潼县北五十里故栎阳县]"}],"path":"历代州域形势纪要/一、唐虞 三代 春秋 战国 秦（卷一）","source_name":"读史方舆纪要"},{"display_title":"读史方舆纪要/〇、封域山川险要（卷五十二）","excerpts":[{"context_after":"其尽得河西，则犀首张仪之力也]。《吕氏春秋》：吴起去西河...","context_before":"...摎留谓韩王，魏两用犀首张仪，而西河之外亡。是也[吕氏曰：","source_end_index":442,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"8e5a0768-dfec-539f-9b20-8e795d4ab86a","source_start_index":430,"source_text":"秦孝公用商鞅，取河西地。"},{"context_after":"十年，东地渡洛[此即渭北之洛川，所谓自郑滨洛者也]。贾生...","context_before":"...削，秦日益大。《秦纪》：穆公时，常得河西地，而晋复取之。","source_end_index":593,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"8e5a0768-dfec-539f-9b20-8e795d4ab86a","source_start_index":566,"source_text":"故孝公元年下令曰：三晋攻夺我河西地。于是出兵东围陕城。"}],"path":"陕西方舆纪要/〇、封域山川险要（卷五十二）","source_name":"读史方舆纪要"},{"display_title":"读史方舆纪要/一、西安府（卷五十三）","excerpts":[{"context_after":"项羽入秦，封司马欣为塞王，都栎阳。颜氏曰：国以塞名者，取...","context_before":"...公十一年，秦取我栎，是也。杜氏《释例》云：栎，盖在河北。","source_end_index":75,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"e341f74b-6355-5c69-bea9-c5cd15021b12","source_start_index":53,"source_text":"《史记》：秦献公二年，自雍徙都栎阳，因城之。"}],"path":"陕西方舆纪要/一、西安府（卷五十三）","source_name":"读史方舆纪要"}],"class_tags":["内政","人事"],"content":"1孝公下令國中曰：「昔我穆公，自岐、雍之間修德行武，東平晉亂，以河爲界，西霸戎翟，廣地千里，天子致伯，諸侯畢賀，爲後世開業甚光美。會往者厲、躁、簡公、出子之不寧，國家內憂，未遑外事。三晉攻奪我先君河西地，醜莫大焉。獻公卽位，鎭撫邊境，徙治櫟陽，且欲東伐，復穆公之故地，修穆公之政令。寡人思念先君之意，常痛於心。賓客羣臣有能出奇計強秦者，吾且尊官，與之分土。」於是衞公孫鞅聞是令下，乃西入秦。","content_fanyi":"秦孝公向全国下令说：“从前我们的穆公，在岐山、雍地之间修治德政、整饬武备，向东平息了晋国的内乱，以黄河为界，向西称霸于戎、翟各部，开拓疆土上千里；周天子授予方伯之位，诸侯都来祝贺，为后世开创的基业非常光辉美好。恰逢过去厉公、躁公、简公、出子时期政局不安，国家内部忧患，无暇顾及对外事务。魏、赵、韩三国攻占了我先君留下的河西土地，耻辱没有比这更大的了。献公即位后，镇抚边境，迁都到栎阳，并准备向东征伐，恢复穆公原有的土地，整饬穆公的政令。我追念先君的遗志，常常痛在心头。宾客和群臣中，有能献出奇计使秦国强盛的人，我将授给他尊贵的官职，分封给他土地。”于是卫国的公孙鞅听说这道命令颁布，就西行进入秦国。","content_jianti_auto":"1孝公下令国中曰：「昔我穆公，自岐、雍之间修德行武，东平晋乱，以河为界，西霸戎翟，广地千里，天子致伯，诸侯毕贺，为后世开业甚光美。会往者厉、躁、简公、出子之不宁，国家内忧，未遑外事。三晋攻夺我先君河西地，丑莫大焉。献公即位，镇抚边境，徙治栎阳，且欲东伐，复穆公之故地，修穆公之政令。寡人思念先君之意，常痛于心。宾客群臣有能出奇计强秦者，吾且尊官，与之分土。」于是衞公孙鞅闻是令下，乃西入秦。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":124,"number":1,"reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"8c20515d-db0e-11ef-9a71-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"師古","people_name_jianti_auto":"师古","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"8c22eb13-db0e-11ef-be87-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"劉向","people_name_jianti_auto":"刘向","start_index":4,"tongjian_id":"8c22eb14-db0e-11ef-b85e-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"申子","people_name_jianti_auto":"申子","start_index":10,"tongjian_id":"8c22eb15-db0e-11ef-93de-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"太史公","people_name_jianti_auto":"太史公","start_index":58,"tongjian_id":"8c22eb16-db0e-11ef-a1f1-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"劉原父","people_name_jianti_auto":"刘原父","start_index":73,"tongjian_id":"8c22eb17-db0e-11ef-8c8d-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"衞侯","people_name_jianti_auto":"衞侯","start_index":104,"tongjian_id":"8c22eb18-db0e-11ef-a757-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"衞侯","people_name_jianti_auto":"衞侯","start_index":114,"tongjian_id":"8c22eb19-db0e-11ef-a6f8-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"公孫","people_name_jianti_auto":"公孙","start_index":119,"tongjian_id":"8c22eb1a-db0e-11ef-b0e9-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"衞","place_name_jianti_auto":"衞","start_index":100,"tongjian_id":"8c22eb1b-db0e-11ef-87a6-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"師古曰：劉向別錄云：申子學好刑名。刑名者，循名以責實，其尊君卑臣，崇上抑下，合於六經。說者曰：刑，刑家；名，名家；卽太史公所論六家之二也。此說非。劉原父曰：刑名，卽幷學兩家術耳。公孫非姓氏，以其先出於衞，父爲衞侯則稱爲公子，祖爲衞侯則稱爲公孫。鞅，於兩翻。","note_content_jianti_auto":"师古曰：刘向别录云：申子学好刑名。刑名者，循名以责实，其尊君卑臣，崇上抑下，合于六经。说者曰：刑，刑家；名，名家；即太史公所论六家之二也。此说非。刘原父曰：刑名，即幷学两家术耳。公孙非姓氏，以其先出于衞，父为衞侯则称为公子，祖为衞侯则称为公孙。鞅，于两翻。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":17,"tongjian_id":"8c22eb12-db0e-11ef-a867-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"章","people_name_jianti_auto":"章","start_index":1,"tongjian_id":"8c22eb20-db0e-11ef-866c-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"孔","people_name_jianti_auto":"孔","start_index":19,"tongjian_id":"8c22eb21-db0e-11ef-afb7-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"note_content":"『章：十二行本二字互乙；乙十一行本同；孔本同。』","note_content_jianti_auto":"『章：十二行本二字互乙；乙十一行本同；孔本同。』","note_type":"『章：[^』]*』","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"8c22eb1f-db0e-11ef-bb87-a0d3651f611f"}],"note_content":"","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":50,"tongjian_id":"8c22eb1e-db0e-11ef-b69b-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"相，息亮翻。痤，才戈翻。不可諱，謂死也。俗語有之：「人不諱死。」","note_content_jianti_auto":"相，息亮翻。痤，才戈翻。不可讳，谓死也。俗语有之：「人不讳死。」","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":54,"tongjian_id":"8c22eb22-db0e-11ef-8b0a-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"戰國","place_name_jianti_auto":"战国","start_index":1,"tongjian_id":"8c22eb24-db0e-11ef-81f1-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"自戰國以來，大夫之家有中庶子，有舍人。","note_content_jianti_auto":"自战国以来，大夫之家有中庶子，有舍人。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":74,"tongjian_id":"8c22eb23-db0e-11ef-b0da-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"先、後，皆去聲。","note_content_jianti_auto":"先、后，皆去声。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":138,"tongjian_id":"8c22eb27-db0e-11ef-af02-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"此先、後，皆如字。爲，于僞翻。","note_content_jianti_auto":"此先、后，皆如字。为，于伪翻。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":149,"tongjian_id":"8c22eb28-db0e-11ef-b5e9-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"康","people_name_jianti_auto":"康","start_index":22,"tongjian_id":"8c22eb2c-db0e-11ef-ae94-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"景","people_name_jianti_auto":"景","start_index":25,"tongjian_id":"8c22eb2d-db0e-11ef-b543-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"楚","place_name_jianti_auto":"楚","start_index":29,"tongjian_id":"8c22eb2e-db0e-11ef-91bc-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"嬖，博計翻，又卑義翻。史記正義：監，甲暫翻。康曰：景，姓，楚之族。監，古銜切，非。","note_content_jianti_auto":"嬖，博计翻，又卑义翻。史记正义：监，甲暂翻。康曰：景，姓，楚之族。监，古衔切，非。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":245,"tongjian_id":"8c22eb2b-db0e-11ef-84de-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[{"confidence":0.9,"official_category":"地方行政","official_name":"公","official_note":"在《资治通鉴》中，“公”常作为对诸侯或高级官员的尊称，此处“魏相公叔痤”指魏国的相国公叔痤，公叔痤是魏国的相国，属于中枢机构的高官，负责辅佐国君处理政务。","official_rank":"未知","source_snippet":"魏相公叔痤","start_index":28,"tongjian_id":"1c669029-1e30-40fb-bb0a-8b24b607c657"},{"confidence":0.85,"official_category":"中枢近臣","official_name":"中庶子","official_note":"中庶子是战国时期诸侯国中的官职，通常负责侍从、文书或顾问工作，此处指公叔痤的中庶子卫鞅，表明卫鞅在魏国担任此职，是公叔痤的属官。","official_rank":"未知","source_snippet":"痤之中庶子衞鞅","start_index":56,"tongjian_id":"ca22a77a-d20f-40e9-9006-71146f5153fc"},{"confidence":0.8,"official_category":"宫廷侍从","official_name":"嬖臣","official_note":"嬖臣指受君主宠幸的近臣或侍从，此处景监是秦孝公的嬖臣，卫鞅通过他求见孝公，表明嬖臣在宫廷中具有接近君主的特权，常参与引荐或顾问事务。","official_rank":"未知","source_snippet":"因嬖臣景監以求見孝公","start_index":200,"tongjian_id":"154850d8-44d4-47b3-830c-5fb7007cea22"}],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"link_birth_year":-390,"link_death_year":-338,"link_td_description":"商鞅（前390年—前338年），又称卫鞅或公孙鞅，是战国中期卫国人，公元前4世纪的重要政治家和军事家，也是法家代表人物之一，师从李悝。","link_td_id":"Q10000225","link_td_number_id":5851,"people_name":"公孫鞅","people_name_jianti_auto":"公孙鞅","people_xingming":"公孙鞅","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"8c24baf6-db0e-11ef-ab9b-a0d3651f611f"},{"link_death_year":-360,"link_td_description":"公叔痤，中国战国时期魏国的相国。又作公孙痤或公叔座，历仕魏武侯、魏惠王。","link_td_id":"Q10003024","link_td_number_id":1628877,"people_name":"公叔痤","people_name_jianti_auto":"公叔痤","people_xingming":"公叔痤","start_index":20,"tongjian_id":"8c24baf8-db0e-11ef-9b00-a0d3651f611f"},{"link_death_year":-360,"link_td_description":"公叔痤，中国战国时期魏国的相国。又作公孙痤或公叔座，历仕魏武侯、魏惠王。","link_td_id":"Q10003024","link_td_number_id":1628877,"people_name":"痤","people_name_jianti_auto":"痤","people_xingming":"公叔痤","start_index":24,"tongjian_id":"8c24baf9-db0e-11ef-a986-a0d3651f611f"},{"link_birth_year":-400,"link_death_year":-319,"link_td_description":"魏惠王，本名魏罃，一作魏婴，魏武侯之子，生于魏文侯二十五年（前400年），全谥为魏文惠王或魏惠成王，通称魏惠王，战国时期魏国的第三代君主，在位期间为前370年－前319年。原本为侯，五国相王后称王，在位时期魏国由盛至衰。《孟子》一书中又称其为梁惠王，《庄子》中称文惠君。","link_td_id":"Q10000501","link_td_number_id":334595,"people_name":"魏惠王","people_name_jianti_auto":"魏惠王","people_xingming":"魏罃","start_index":36,"tongjian_id":"8c24bafa-db0e-11ef-a34e-a0d3651f611f","wl_zhushi":"[魏罃]"},{"link_death_year":-360,"link_td_description":"公叔痤，中国战国时期魏国的相国。又作公孙痤或公叔座，历仕魏武侯、魏惠王。","link_td_id":"Q10003024","link_td_number_id":1628877,"people_name":"公叔","people_name_jianti_auto":"公叔","people_xingming":"公叔痤","start_index":45,"tongjian_id":"8c24baf